#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What the Ditana repository distributes, under which licences, where the corresponding source code is, and why the ZFS packages are packaged the way they are."
msgstr "Tge ch’il repositori da Ditana distribuescha, sut tge licenzas, nua ch’il code da funtauna correspundent sa chatta e pertge ch’ils pachets ZFS èn preparads uschia sco ch’els èn."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Licensing"
msgstr "Licenzas"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"Almost everything on a Ditana system comes from Arch's own repositories "
"under Arch's terms. This page is about the packages Ditana builds itself and "
"serves from `ditana.org` — in particular the ZFS ones, because ZFS on Linux "
"carries a licence question that a distribution has to answer explicitly "
"rather than by accident."
msgstr ""
"Bunamain tut sin in sistem da Ditana deriva dals agens repositoris dad Arch, "
"tenor las cundiziuns dad Arch. Questa pagina tracta ils pachets che Ditana "
"construescha sez e porscha sin `ditana.org` – cunzunt ils pachets ZFS, "
"perquai ch’i dat tar ZFS sin Linux ina dumonda da licenza, a la quala ina "
"distribuziun sto respunder explicitamain e betg per cas."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"It describes what Ditana does and links the primary sources so you can read "
"them instead of taking this page's word for anything. It is not legal advice."
msgstr ""
"Ella descriva tge che Ditana fa e renviescha cun colliaziuns a las funtaunas "
"primaras, uschia che Vus pudais leger quellas empè da crair simplamain a "
"questa pagina. Ella n’è betg in cussegl giuridic."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ZFS packages"
msgstr "Ils pachets ZFS"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What Ditana distributes"
msgstr "Tge che Ditana distribuescha"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package | Contents | Licence |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `zfs-utils` | The userspace tools and libraries — `zfs`, `zpool`, `zed`, udev rules, systemd units. | [CDDL-1.0](https://opensource.org/license/cddl-1-0) |\n"
"| `zfs-dkms` | Source code only. It unpacks the OpenZFS module sources into `/usr/src/zfs-<version>/` together with a `dkms.conf`. It contains no compiled kernel module. | [CDDL-1.0](https://opensource.org/license/cddl-1-0) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pachet | Cuntegn | Licenza |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `zfs-utils` | Ils utensils e las bibliotecas userspace – `zfs`, `zpool`, `zed`, reglas udev, unitads systemd. | [CDDL-1.0](https://opensource.org/license/cddl-1-0) |\n"
"| `zfs-dkms` | Mo code da funtauna. El metta las funtaunas dal modul OpenZFS en `/usr/src/zfs-<version>/`, ensemen cun ina datoteca `dkms.conf`. El na cuntegna nagin modul dal kernel cumpilà. | [CDDL-1.0](https://opensource.org/license/cddl-1-0) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"`zfs.ko`, the kernel module itself, is compiled by DKMS **on your machine**, "
"against the kernel running on your machine, when `zfs-dkms` is installed and "
"again after every kernel update. It is never built on a Ditana build host, "
"never signed by Ditana, and never uploaded anywhere. You can check this on "
"an installed system:"
msgstr ""
"`zfs.ko`, il modul dal kernel sez, vegn cumpilà da DKMS **sin Vossa "
"maschina**, per il kernel che vegn exequì sin Vossa maschina, cura che `zfs-"
"dkms` vegn installà e danovamain suenter mintga actualisaziun dal kernel. El "
"na vegn mai construì sin in host da build da Ditana, mai signà da Ditana e "
"mai chargià si nagliur. Vus pudais controllar quai sin in sistem installà:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pacman -Ql zfs-dkms | grep -c '\\.ko$'    # 0\n"
msgstr "pacman -Ql zfs-dkms | grep -c '\\.ko$'    # 0\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The licence question"
msgstr "La dumonda da licenza"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"[OpenZFS](https://github.com/openzfs/zfs) is licensed under the CDDL. The "
"Linux kernel is licensed under the GPL version 2. The [Free Software "
"Foundation](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-list.html#CDDL)  lists the "
"CDDL as a free software licence that is incompatible with the GPL, and the "
"Software Freedom Conservancy reached the same conclusion in its [2016 "
"analysis](https://sfconservancy.org/blog/2016/feb/25/zfs-and-linux/).  "
"Canonical published the [opposing position](https://ubuntu.com/blog/zfs-"
"licensing-and-linux) that same year. The disagreement has never been tested "
"in court and remains unresolved."
msgstr ""
"[OpenZFS](https://github.com/openzfs/zfs) è licenzià sut la CDDL. Il kernel "
"da Linux è licenzià sut la GPL versiun 2. La [Free Software Foundation]"
"(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-list.html#CDDL) enumerescha la CDDL "
"sco licenza da software libra che n’è betg cumpatibla cun la GPL, e la "
"Software Freedom Conservancy è arrivada a la medema conclusiun en sia "
"[analisa dal 2016](https://sfconservancy.org/blog/2016/feb/25/zfs-and-"
"linux/). Canonical ha publitgà il medem onn la [posiziun cuntraria](https://"
"ubuntu.com/blog/zfs-licensing-and-linux). Il dischaccord n’è mai vegnì "
"examinà davant dretgira e resta avert."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"What the disagreement is *about* is narrow: whether a **compiled binary that "
"combines** CDDL-covered OpenZFS code with GPL-covered kernel code may be "
"distributed. That artefact is `zfs.ko`."
msgstr ""
"Il *tema* dal dischaccord è stretg: sch’ina **datoteca binara cumpilada che "
"cumbina** code dad OpenZFS sut la CDDL cun code dal kernel sut la GPL dastga "
"vegnir distribuida. Quest artefact è `zfs.ko`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"Source code is not such a combination, and neither is userspace: `zfs-utils` "
"contains no kernel code and is not linked against any. Neither package "
"Ditana ships is the artefact under dispute."
msgstr ""
"Il code da funtauna n’è betg ina tala cumbinaziun, e la software userspace "
"n’è er betg ina: `zfs-utils` na cuntegna nagin code dal kernel e n’è betg "
"collià cun code dal kernel. Nagin dals dus pachets che Ditana furnescha n’è "
"l’artefact contestà."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where that leaves Ditana"
msgstr "Tge che quai munta per Ditana"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"Ditana distributes the sources and the userspace tools, and lets DKMS build "
"the module locally. That is the same arrangement [Debian uses](https://"
"wiki.debian.org/ZFS): a DKMS source package, no prebuilt modules in the "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"Ditana distribuescha las funtaunas ed ils utensils userspace e lascha DKMS "
"construir il modul localmain. Quai è il medem arranschament che [Debian "
"utilisescha](https://wiki.debian.org/ZFS): in pachet da funtaunas DKMS, "
"nagins moduls gia cumpilads en il repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"It is deliberately *not* the arrangement used by projects that ship a ready-"
"built module — [archzfs](https://github.com/archzfs/archzfs), for example, "
"offers precompiled `zfs-linux` packages alongside its DKMS variant, and "
"Canonical ships the module with Ubuntu on the strength of the position "
"linked above. Those projects distribute the combined binary. Ditana does "
"not, and the choice is the reason this page exists."
msgstr ""
"Quai n’è aposta *betg* l’arranschament da projects che furneschan in modul "
"gia construì – [archzfs](https://github.com/archzfs/archzfs) p.ex. porscha "
"pachets `zfs-linux` gia cumpilads sper sia varianta DKMS, e Canonical "
"furnescha il modul cun Ubuntu sin basa da la posiziun colliada survart. "
"Quests projects distribueschan la datoteca binara cumbinada. Ditana na fa "
"betg quai, e questa tscherna è il motiv pertge che questa pagina exista."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"The practical cost of that choice is real and is not hidden: a kernel update "
"on a Ditana system recompiles the module locally, which takes minutes and "
"needs the matching kernel headers. This is why the installer offers ZFS only "
"together with the long-term support kernel: the ZFS entry appears in the "
"File System dialog only while that kernel is selected, and disappears when "
"you pick another one – a non-LTS kernel can move ahead of what OpenZFS "
"supports and leave DKMS unable to build. [How settings depend on each other]"
"(/under-the-hood/settings-logic/) shows the two declarations that do this."
msgstr ""
"Il cust pratic da questa tscherna è real e na vegn betg zuppà: "
"in’actualisaziun dal kernel sin in sistem da Ditana cumpilescha danovamain "
"il modul localmain, quai che dura minutas e dovra ils headers dal kernel "
"correspundents. Perquai porscha l’installatur ZFS mo ensemen cun il kernel "
"cun sustegn a lunga durada: l’endataziun ZFS cumpara en il dialog File "
"System mo uschè ditg che quest kernel è tschernì, e svanescha cura che Vus "
"tschernis in auter – in kernel che n’è betg in kernel LTS po avanzar ultra "
"quai ch’OpenZFS sustegna, e DKMS na po lura betg pli construir il modul. [Co "
"ch’ils parameters dependan l’in da l’auter](/under-the-hood/settings-logic/) "
"mussa las duas decleraziuns che fan quai."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"The installer states the licence prior to your selection: the File System "
"dialog carries `CDDL` on the ZFS entry, the way package selections carry "
"their SPDX identifier."
msgstr ""
"L’installatur inditgescha la licenza gia avant Vossa tscherna: il dialog "
"File System mussa `CDDL` sin l’endataziun ZFS, uschia sco che las tschernas "
"da pachets mussan lur identificatur SPDX."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ZFSBootMenu"
msgstr "ZFSBootMenu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"[ZFSBootMenu](https://github.com/zbm-dev/zfsbootmenu) is the bootloader "
"Ditana installs on ZFS systems. It is licensed under the MIT licence and "
"contains no OpenZFS code — it is a set of shell and Perl scripts that call "
"the `zfs` and `zpool` commands. The question above does not arise for it."
msgstr ""
"[ZFSBootMenu](https://github.com/zbm-dev/zfsbootmenu) è il bootloader che "
"Ditana installescha sin sistems ZFS. El è licenzià sut la licenza MIT e na "
"cuntegna nagin code dad OpenZFS – el è ina collecziun da scripts da shell e "
"da Perl che cloman ils cumonds `zfs` e `zpool`. La dumonda survart n’è betg "
"relevanta per el."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"The boot image on your machine is generated locally during installation, by "
"`generate-zbm` operating within the target system, using the components "
"present there. On a UEFI machine it is an EFI bundle located at `/boot/efi/"
"EFI/zbm/`, copied to `/boot/efi/EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI` as well; on a BIOS "
"machine it is `/boot/syslinux/zfsbootmenu/initramfs-bootmenu.img`."
msgstr ""
"Il maletg d’aviar sin Vossa maschina vegn generà localmain durant "
"l’installaziun, da `generate-zbm` che vegn exequì en il sistem da "
"destinaziun, cun las cumponentas che sa chattan là. Sin ina maschina UEFI è "
"el in bundle EFI en `/boot/efi/EFI/zbm/`, copià er en `/boot/efi/EFI/BOOT/"
"BOOTX64.EFI`; sin ina maschina BIOS è el `/boot/syslinux/zfsbootmenu/"
"initramfs-bootmenu.img`."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Corresponding source code"
msgstr "Code da funtauna correspundent"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"The CDDL is a file-level copyleft: whoever distributes binaries built from "
"CDDL-covered files has to make the corresponding source available and keep "
"the licence notices intact. Ditana distributes `zfs-utils` as a binary "
"package, so this applies."
msgstr ""
"La CDDL è in copyleft al nivel da las datotecas: tgi che distribuescha "
"datotecas binaras construidas a partir da datotecas sut la CDDL, sto metter "
"a disposiziun il code da funtauna correspundent e mantegnair intactas las "
"indicaziuns da licenza. Ditana distribuescha `zfs-utils` sco pachet binar, "
"perquai vala quai."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"For every package in the Ditana repository the recipe is public. Packages "
"taken from the AUR unchanged, and Ditana's forks of them, carry their "
"upstream address in the recipe; Ditana's own packages are built from the "
"repository of the same name under [github.com/acrion](https://github.com/"
"acrion); and the handful taken from Arch's own packaging carry the address "
"of the corresponding repository on gitlab.archlinux.org. The recipe names "
"the exact upstream archive it fetches and the checksum it is verified "
"against, which is the corresponding source in the sense the licence means."
msgstr ""
"Per mintga pachet en il repositori da Ditana è il recept public. Pachets "
"ch’èn vegnids prendids da l’AUR senza midadas, ed ils forks da Ditana da "
"quests pachets, cuntegnan en il recept lur adressa d’origin; ils agens "
"pachets da Ditana vegnan construids dal repositori cun il medem num sut "
"[github.com/acrion](https://github.com/acrion); ed ils paucs pachets "
"prendids dals agens recepts dad Arch cuntegnan l’adressa dal repositori "
"correspundent sin gitlab.archlinux.org. Il recept numna l’archiv d’origin "
"exact ch’el telechargia e la summa da controlla, cun la quala l’archiv vegn "
"verifitgà, e quai è il code da funtauna correspundent en il senn da la "
"licenza."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid "For the packages on this page:"
msgstr "Per ils pachets sin questa pagina:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package | Recipe | Upstream source |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `zfs-utils` | [aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-utils](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-utils) | [github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases](https://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases) |\n"
"| `zfs-dkms` | [aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-dkms](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-dkms) | [github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases](https://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases) |\n"
"| `zfsbootmenu` | [aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfsbootmenu](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfsbootmenu) | [github.com/zbm-dev/zfsbootmenu](https://github.com/zbm-dev/zfsbootmenu) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pachet | Recept | Funtauna d’origin |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `zfs-utils` | [aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-utils](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-utils) | [github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases](https://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases) |\n"
"| `zfs-dkms` | [aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-dkms](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-dkms) | [github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases](https://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases) |\n"
"| `zfsbootmenu` | [aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfsbootmenu](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfsbootmenu) | [github.com/zbm-dev/zfsbootmenu](https://github.com/zbm-dev/zfsbootmenu) |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"Ditana's ZFS recipes carry no Ditana patches: the packages are built from "
"the upstream AUR recipes as published. `pacman -Qi zfs-utils` names the "
"exact version installed on your machine, and the recipe's AUR history has a "
"commit for that version. Every run that produced these packages is recorded "
"under [Build status](/builds/)."
msgstr ""
"Ils recepts ZFS da Ditana na cuntegnan nagins patches da Ditana: ils pachets "
"vegnan construids dals recepts d’origin da l’AUR, uschia sco ch’els èn "
"publitgads. `pacman -Qi zfs-utils` numna la versiun exacta installada sin "
"Vossa maschina, e l’istorgia dal recept en l’AUR cuntegna in commit per "
"questa versiun. Mintga execuziun che ha producì quests pachets è registrada "
"sut [Status dals builds](/builds/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"The full text of the CDDL-1.0 is at [opensource.org/license/cddl-1-0]"
"(https://opensource.org/license/cddl-1-0) and in the `COPYRIGHT` and "
"`LICENSE` files of the OpenZFS source tree linked above."
msgstr ""
"Il text cumplet da la CDDL-1.0 sa chatta sin [opensource.org/license/"
"cddl-1-0](https://opensource.org/license/cddl-1-0) ed en las datotecas "
"`COPYRIGHT` e `LICENSE` dal code da funtauna dad OpenZFS collià survart."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"If you cannot locate the corresponding source for any package Ditana "
"distributes, write to [support@ditana.org](mailto:support@ditana.org) and "
"you will be pointed at it or sent it."
msgstr ""
"Sche Vus na chattais betg il code da funtauna correspundent d’in pachet che "
"Ditana distribuescha, scrivai a [support@ditana.org]"
"(mailto:support@ditana.org); lura survegnis Vus l’indicaziun nua ch’el sa "
"chatta, u il code sez."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ditana's own code"
msgstr "L’agen code da Ditana"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"The installer engine, its knowledge base, and the tooling around them are "
"Ditana's own work:"
msgstr ""
"Il motor da l’installatur, sia basa da savida ed ils utensils enturn quels "
"èn l’atgna lavur da Ditana:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Project | Licence |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| [ditana-installer](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer) | GPL-3.0-or-later |\n"
"| [ditana-config](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-config) | AGPL-3.0-or-later |\n"
"| [ditana-build](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-build) | AGPL-3.0-or-later |\n"
"| [ditana-userns-guard](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-userns-guard) | AGPL-3.0-or-later, except the BPF program itself (`userns_guard.bpf.c`) and the kernel type declarations it needs (`kernel_types.h`), which are GPL-2.0-or-later because the kernel refuses GPL-only helpers to a program that is not |\n"
"| [zfs-autosnap](https://github.com/acrion/zfs-autosnap) | AGPL-3.0-or-later |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Project | Licenza |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| [ditana-installer](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer) | GPL-3.0-or-later |\n"
"| [ditana-config](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-config) | AGPL-3.0-or-later |\n"
"| [ditana-build](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-build) | AGPL-3.0-or-later |\n"
"| [ditana-userns-guard](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-userns-guard) | AGPL-3.0-or-later, cun excepziun dal program BPF sez (`userns_guard.bpf.c`) e da las decleraziuns da tips dal kernel ch’el dovra (`kernel_types.h`), ch’èn licenziads sut GPL-2.0-or-later, perquai ch’il kernel refusa las funcziuns d’agid reservadas a la GPL ad in program che n’ha betg ina licenza GPL |\n"
"| [zfs-autosnap](https://github.com/acrion/zfs-autosnap) | AGPL-3.0-or-later |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"zfs-autosnap is Ditana's own pre-upgrade snapshot hook, not OpenZFS code; it "
"is installed by default on every ZFS system."
msgstr ""
"zfs-autosnap è l’agen hook da Ditana che fa in snapshot avant mintga "
"actualisaziun, betg code dad OpenZFS; el vegn installà sco standard sin "
"mintga sistem ZFS."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Not legal advice"
msgstr "Betg in cussegl giuridic"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/licensing.md
msgid ""
"This page is written by Ditana's maintainer, not by a lawyer, and it is a "
"description of Ditana's packaging rather than an opinion on anyone else's. "
"The CDDL/GPL question is genuinely contested by parties who have taken it "
"seriously, and every position referenced here is linked so you can read the "
"argument yourself. If you are redistributing these packages, or building "
"products on top of them, get your own advice."
msgstr ""
"Questa pagina è scritta dal responsabel da Ditana, betg d’in’advocata u d’in "
"advocat, ed ella è ina descripziun da la moda co che Ditana prepara ses "
"pachets e betg in’opiniun davart la moda d’auters. La dumonda CDDL/GPL è "
"propi contestada tranter partidas che han tractà seriusamain quest tema, e "
"mintga posiziun menziunada qua è colliada, uschia che Vus pudais leger "
"persunalmain l’argumentaziun. Sche Vus distribuis vinavant quests pachets u "
"construis products sin basa da quels, dumandai in agen cussegl."
